These four landscape photos are part of the day-card plugin and are covered by
that package's MIT license. The plugin's NOTICE excludes only the Amp logo;
it states no exception for these photos.

The files here are the upstream 1000x1500 JPEGs, unchanged. They are embedded
into the AnyPic binary at build time (see backgrounds.go); no image is fetched
over the network or read from the user's disk.

